From b97af3c3b04dcf860423b559d0a4346ffccbec38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ihormd <103286172+ihormd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:19:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Vercel build: pin @tanstack/router-core to 1.171.34

npm hoisted router-core 1.171.15 (pinned exactly by router-plugin and router-generator) to the top level, so the SSR bundle resolved it and missed bindSsrResponseToRequest and createRawStreamRPCPlugin that react-start 1.168.60 needs. An explicit dependency forces top-level 1.171.34; the nested 1.171.15 copies under the build-time plugin/generator stay harmless.

package-lock.json added so npm installs (which Vercel uses) are deterministic instead of resolving fresh from bun.lock's absence.
---
 package-lock.json | 431 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 package.json      |   1 +
 2 files changed, 312 insertions(+), 120 deletions(-)

